208 plans to restore the historic hunt  ridge theater are moving forward this  morning  las vegas city council unanimously  agreed yesterday  to put local developer jay dapper in  charge of the project  his company has already taken on several  projects in the area  of charleston and maryland parkway no  specific plans for the theater have been  announced yet  but developers previously said it would  include some sort of entertainment venue  under this new agreement dapper must  keep the city's historic preservation  commission  updated on the progress john
 

